---
const appStore =
  "https://apps.apple.com/vn/app/iopgps/id6446336643";

const googlePlay =
  "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ww.iopgps";
---

<html lang="vi">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8" />

<title>Tải ứng dụng An Tâm GPS</title>

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<script>

const ua=navigator.userAgent;

if(/iPhone|iPad|iPod/i.test(ua)){
window.location.href="https://apps.apple.com/vn/app/iopgps/id6446336643";
}

else if(/Android/i.test(ua)){
window.location.href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ww.iopgps";
}

</script>

<style>

body{

font-family:Arial;

background:#ffffff;

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

height:100vh;

margin:0;

}

.card{

width:420px;

padding:40px;

text-align:center;

border-radius:20px;

box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.12);

}

.logo{

font-size:32px;

font-weight:700;

color:#0057B8;

}

.green{

color:#39B54A;

}

.btn{

display:block;

margin:15px auto;

padding:14px;

border-radius:12px;

text-decoration:none;

font-weight:600;

color:white;

background:#0057B8;

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<div class="logo">

AN TÂM <span class="green">GPS</span>

</div>

<h2>Tải ứng dụng</h2>

<p>

Nếu điện thoại không tự chuyển, hãy chọn cửa hàng bên dưới.

</p>

<a class="btn" href={appStore}>

 App Store

</a>

<a class="btn" href={googlePlay}>

▶ Google Play

</a>

</div>

</body>

</html>